#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.kolourpaint.appdata.xml:6
msgid "KolourPaint"
msgstr "KolourPaint"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.kolourpaint.appdata.xml:7
msgid "Paint Program"
msgstr "Programa de pintura"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kolourpaint.appdata.xml:9
msgid ""
"KolourPaint is a simple painting program to quickly create raster images. It "
"is useful as a touch-up tool and simple image editing tasks."
msgstr ""
"KolourPaint ye un programa cenciellu de pintura pa crear aína imáxenes "
"en mapa de bits. Ye útil como ferramienta de retoque y edición de xeres "
"básiques."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kolourpaint.appdata.xml:13
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Carauterístiques:"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kolourpaint.appdata.xml:15
msgid ""
"Support for drawing various shapes - lines, rectangles, rounded rectangles, "
"ovals and polygons"
msgstr ""
"Sofitu pa dibuxu en varies formes - llinies, rectángulos, rectángulos"
" redondos, "
"óvalos y polígonos"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
